hadiths[7]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1761","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main un par ghairat karti thi jinhon-ne apne aap ko Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko tohfey mein diya tha. Aur main kehti: Kya aurat apne aap ko tohfey mein deti hai? Phir jab Allah Taala ne naazil farmaya: (Tum un mein se jise chaaaho peechey karo aur jise chaaaho apne paas rakkho. Aur jise tum ne alag kya us mein se talab karo to tum par gunaah nahi hai). To main ne kaha: Main tumhaarey Rab ko tumhaari khwaahish mein jaldi karney waley key siwa nahi dekhti. (Bukhari: 4788)"
"1762","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Aisha Raziallahu anha se) riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ham mein se aurat key din mein ijazat maangtey they, us aayat key naazil honay key baad: (Tum un mein se jise chaaaho peechey karo aur jise chaaaho apne paas rakkho. Aur jise tum ne alag kya us mein se talab karo to tum par gunaah nahi hai). To main Aap se kehti thi: Agar wo merey paas ho to beshak main Ya Rasulullah nahi chaahten ke tum par kisi ko tarjeeh dun. (Bukhari: 4789). Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Zainab bint Jahsh se roti aur gosht key sath nikaah kya. To main khaaney par bul aaney key liye bheja gaya. To qaum aati aur khaati aur nikalti. Phir qaum aati aur khaati aur nikalti. To main ne bulaaya yahan tak ke main kisi ko na paata jise bulaaun. To main ne kaha: Ae Allah key Nabi! Main kisi ko nahi paata jise bulaaun. Aap ne farmaya: Apna khaana uthao! Aur teen aadmi ghar mein baat kartey huey baaqi rahey. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) nikley aur Aisha key hujrey ki taraf chaley. To Aap ne farmaya: Assalaamu Alaikum ae ghar walon, aur Allah ki rehmat! To unhon-ne kaha: Aur tum par salaam aur Allah ki rehmat! Tum ne apne ghar walon ko kaisa paaya? Allah tumhey barkat dey! To Aap Aapki biwiyon key hujron mein phirey. Un sab se farmatey jaisa Aap ne Aisha se farmaya tha. Aur wo Aap se kehten jaisa Aisha ne Aap se kaha tha. Phir Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) wapas aey aur teen aadmi ghar mein baat kartey huey they. Jabke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) sakht sharmilay they. To Aap nikley aur Aisha key hujrey ki taraf chaley. To mujhey nahi maloom Aap ko khabar di gai ya khabar di gai ke qaum nikli hai. To Aap wapas aey yahan tak ke jab Aap ne apna paon darwaazey ki chaukhat mein andar rakkha aur doosra baahar, Aap ne merey aur apne darmiyaan parda latka diya. Aur Hijaab ki aayat naazil hui. (4793). Ye hadees Ziya-ud-Daaghistani key zawaed mein se hai aur Zabidi key asl mein se nahi hai. Allah Taala ka qaul: (Ae imaan walon! Nabi key gharon mein daakhil na ho) aayat."
"1763","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Sauda Hijaab lagaaney key baad apni haajat key liye niklein. Jabke wo bhari jism wali aurat thein jo usey pehchaanta tha us par chhupi na theen. To Umar bin Khattab ne unhey dekha aur unhon-ne kaha: Ae Sauda! Allah ki qasam tum ham se nahi chhupteen! To dekho kaisey nikalteen ho! Unhon-ne kaha: To wo wapas aaein jabke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) merey ghar mein they jabke Aap raat ka khaana kha rahey they jabke Aap key haath mein haddi thi. To wo daakhil huin aur unhon-ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak main apni baaz haajat key liye nikli. To mujh se Umar ne aisa aisa kaha. Unhon-ne kaha: To Allah ne Aap par wahi ki, phir Aap se (wo kefiyat) uthai gai jabke haddi Aap key haath mein thi, Aap ne use nahi rakkha tha. To Aap ne farmaya: Beshak tumhey ijazat di gai hai ke tum apni haajat key liye niklo. (Bukhari: 4795). Allah Taala ka qaul: (Agar tum kuchh zaahir karo ya chhupaao) aayat."
"1764","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Merey paas Aflah ne ijazat maangi jo Abu Quais ka bhai tha, Hijaab naazil honay key baad. To main ne kaha: Main use ijazat na dungi yahan tak ke main uskey baarey mein Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se ijazat maangun. Beshak uska bhai Abu Quais ne mujhey doodh nahi pilaaya tha. Lekin mujhey Abu Quais ki biwi ne doodh pilaaya tha. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) merey paas daakhil huey aur main ne Aap se kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak Abu Quais key bhai Aflah ne ijazat maangi aur main ne use ijazat deney se inkaar kar diya yahan tak ke main tum se ijazat maangun. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tumhey use ijazat deney se kis ne mana kya, tumhaarey chacha? Main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak aadmi ne mujhey doodh nahi pilaaya tha. Lekin mujhey Abu Quais ki biwi ne doodh pilaaya tha. To Aap ne farmaya: Use ijazat do, beshak wo tumhaara chacha hai. Tumhaara daahina haath khaak aalood ho! (Bukhari: 4796). Allah Taala ka qaul: (Beshak Allah aur uskey farishtey Nabi par durood bhejtey hain) aayat."
"1765","[AI-translation] Kaab bin Ujra (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, kaha gaya: Ya Rasulullah! Lekin tum par salaam ko ham ne pehchaan liya hai. To tum par durood kaisey hai? Aap ne farmaya: Kaho: Ae Allah! Muhammad aur Aale Muhammad par rehmat bhej jaisa tum ne Aale Ibrahim par rehmat bheji. Beshak tu Taareef wala Buzurg hai. Ae Allah! Muhammad aur Aale Muhammad par barkat bhej jaisa tum ne Aale Ibrahim par barkat bheji. Beshak tu Taareef wala Buzurg hai. (Bukhari: 4797)"
"1766","[AI-translation] Abu Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Ye salaam hai. To ham tum par kaisey durood bhejein? Aap ne farmaya: Kaho: Ae Allah! Muhammad par jo tera banda aur tera Rasool hai rehmat bhej jaisa tum ne Aale Ibrahim par rehmat bheji. Aur Muhammad aur Aale Muhammad par barkat bhej jaisa tum ne Ibrahim par barkat bheji. (Bukhari: 4798). Allah Taala ka qaul: (Un jaisey na ho jinhon-ne Musa ko takleef di)."
"1767","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Musa sharmilay aadmi they. (Bukhari: 4799). Allah Taala ka qaul: (Wo sirf daraaney wala hai tumhaarey liye sakht azaab se pehley)."
